<!-- Teaching layer over exact approved source PR #80, fb8354e. Existing generated interview scaffolding remains unchanged. -->
<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">Two requests receive 401 while one refresh token can be used only once. The app must serialize refresh ownership, preserve a started rotation through caller cancellation, and prevent an old response from entering a new login.</p>

<!-- @after 7. Deep Dive: Token Lifecycle (15 min) :: animation -->
### Follow refresh ownership, not just token arrival

<section class="pb-figure" data-pb-flow="scene" aria-label="Two 401s share one bounded refresh">
